    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511640/extras/5cabd50ddeb04aa924bf02afa40b533f.avif?t=1741198675\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Break the Block</strong></i> is a block-breaking game that challenges your reaction.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must use your skills and various power-ups to break through endless waves of blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit</strong> them, <strong>burn</strong> them, <strong>zap</strong> or <strong>blast</strong>. Do whatever you can, but <strong>break those blocks</strong>!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511640/extras/48689310af2164e895f5d6ab4ea8f1b9.avif?t=1741198675\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Claim the leaderboard ranks and show how far you can go!</strong></i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511640/extras/5cabd50ddeb04aa924bf02afa40b533f.avif?t=1741198675\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Break the Block</strong></i> is a block-breaking game that challenges your reaction.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must use your skills and various power-ups to break through endless waves of blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit</strong> them, <strong>burn</strong> them, <strong>zap</strong> or <strong>blast</strong>. Do whatever you can, but <strong>break those blocks</strong>!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511640/extras/48689310af2164e895f5d6ab4ea8f1b9.avif?t=1741198675\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Claim the leaderboard ranks and show how far you can go!</strong></i></p>",
